config BR2_PACKAGE_RKNPU
	bool "rknpu (Rockchip RK3588 NPU, mainline)"
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	depends on BR2_aarch64
	help
	  Clean-room out-of-tree RKNPU kernel driver for RK3588 that
	  builds directly against mainline Linux (validated on 6.18/7.x).
	  Provides /dev/rknpu, 3-core concurrency, 800MHz devfreq and
	  per-core IOMMU isolation. Pairs with the librknnrt runtime.

	  Binds the mainline "rockchip,rk3588-rknn-core" DT nodes, which
	  the Rock 5B board DT already enables. The in-tree Rocket driver
	  (CONFIG_DRM_ACCEL_ROCKET) binds the same nodes and must stay off.

	  https://github.com/lurenJBD/rk3588-rknn-core
